{"step_index":233,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T06:16:38Z","content":"### 🎓 Student Survival App 🧑‍🎓🔥\n#### *“Survive college. One deadline at a time. 😂”*\n\nThe app has been updated with the requested **Notification Bar & Periodic Reminders** and the **Create Account** interface with built-in **Indian student demo credentials**.\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 What’s New\n\n#### 1. 🔔 Sticky Top Notification Bar & Periodic Reminder Engine\n* **Sticky Top Alert Ticker**: Positioned directly beneath the header. It cycles continuously through all urgent academic items:\n  * 🔴 **Attendance Detention Alerts**: When attendance drops below 75% (e.g. *“COA attendance is 60% — attend 21 classes to hit safe 75%!”*).\n  * ⚠️ **Pending Assignments**: Sorted by proximity (e.g. *“DBMS Normalization due in 2 days!”*).\n  * ⏳ **Upcoming Exams**: Live ticking countdown (e.g. *“OOP / Java Exam in 12 days!”*).\n  * 📅 **Next Lecture**: Timetable alerts for current day classes.\n* **Interactive Controls**: Auto-cycles every 6 seconds with `<` / `>` navigation arrows, pause/resume, and direct action buttons (*“Do It Now 🚀”*).\n* **🔔 Notification Center Drawer**: Click the bell icon in the top navbar to view all alerts categorized by urgency (Critical, Warning, Info).\n* **“Time-to-Time” Reminder Engine**: \n  * Configurable intervals (**1 min**, **3 mins**, **5 mins**, **10 mins**).\n  * Plays collegiate audio chimes with student humor banners (*“☕ Procrastination Detector Fired”*, *“🚨 Academic Reality Check”*).\n  * Supports native browser **Desktop Push Notifications** outside the active tab.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. ➕ “Create Account” Registration System\n* Seamless tab switching between **`[ 🔑 Sign In ]`** and **`[ ➕ Create Account ]`**.\n* The **Create Account** form includes:\n  * 👤 **Full Name** (e.g., *Rohan Gupta*)\n  * 🔑 **Username** (e.g., *rohan_coder*)\n  * 📧 **College Email** (e.g., *rohan.gupta@iitd.ac.in*)\n  * 🔒 **Password & Confirm Password** (with client-side match validation)\n  * 🏛️ **College / University** (e.g., *IIT Delhi, DTU, VIT, NIT Trichy, BITS Pilani*)\n  * 💻 **Branch** (CSE, IT, ECE, AI & Data Science, Mechanical, Electrical)\n  * 🎓 **Semester** (Semester 1 through 8)\n  * 🎯 **Target Attendance %** (75% Minimum, 80% Safe Buffer, 85%, 90% Parent Pride 🏆)\n* Instant login upon registration with user data saved in `localStorage`.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. 🇮🇳 Demo Indian Student Profiles (1-Click Login)\n\nThe **Sign In** screen includes **1-Click Quick Demo Login** buttons and a **“View Demo Passwords 📋”** cheat sheet modal:\n\n| Student Name | Username | College Email | Password | College / Branch | Sem | Status |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Aman Sharma** | `aman_sharma` | `aman.sharma@college.edu` | `password123` | DTU • CSE | 4 | 🟢 80% Safe (Can miss 2) |\n| **Priya Patel** | `priya_patel` | `priya.patel@nit.ac.in` | `priyapassword` | NIT Trichy • IT | 4 | 🟢 88% Safe (Can miss 6) |\n| **Rahul Verma** | `rahul_v` | `rahul.verma@vit.edu.in` | `rahulpass2026` | VIT • ECE | 4 | 🔴 65% Shortage Alert! |\n| **Ananya Iyer** | `ananya_iyer` | `ananya.iyer@bits-pilani.ac.in` | `ananyapass` | BITS Pilani • AI & DS | 6 | ⭐ 92% College Topper |\n| **Rohan Gupta** | `rohan_gupta` | `rohan.gupta@iitd.ac.in` | `rohanpass` | IIT Delhi • CSE | 4 | 🟡 72% Borderline Warning |\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 How to Launch & Test\n\nBoth project folders have been synchronized with matching SHA256 hashes:\n\n- **Desktop Folder**: [index.html](file:///C:/Users/DELL/OneDrive/Desktop/student%20survival/student-survival-app/index.html)\n- **Workspace Folder**: [index.html](file:///C:/Users/DELL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/student-survival-app/index.html)\n\n#### Testing Steps:\n1. Double-click [index.html](file:///C:/Users/DELL/OneDrive/Desktop/student%20survival/student-survival-app/index.html) to open in your browser (Edge / Chrome).\n2. On the login screen:\n   * Click any **Quick Demo Login** card (e.g., **Aman Sharma** or **Rahul Verma**) to enter survival mode with a single click.\n   * Or click **`[ ➕ Create Account ]`**, fill in your details, and hit **Create My Survival Account**.\n3. Once logged in, observe the **Sticky Notification Bar** at the top cycling through pending assignments and shortage alerts.\n4. Click the **🔔 Bell Icon** in the header to open the Notification Center, customize your reminder frequency (e.g. 1 min for testing), or enable desktop push notifications."}
